# API Reference

:::note
The generated OpenAPI reference is planned for `docusaurus-plugin-openapi-docs` integration. Once the plugin is installed and configured, this page will display interactive API documentation from the OpenAPI spec.

For now, see the [hand-written endpoint table](../reference/api.md) or the [OpenAPI spec on GitHub](https://github.com/zenmesh/zen-platform-hermes/blob/main/api-specifications/zen-back.v1.yaml).
:::

## Planned Integration

When the OpenAPI docs plugin is configured and `npm install` completes, this page will render:

- Per-endpoint documentation from `zen-back.v1.yaml`
- Interactive Try It console (sandbox, read-only)
- Request/response schemas
- Auth requirements per endpoint
